Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.38,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,它呀，夜里才开花。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.38,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Den blommar på natten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.50,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,我没看见花啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.50,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Jag ser inga blommor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.74,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,得等上十年。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.74,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Det tar tio år.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:13.63,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,只开一晚，然后它就死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:13.63,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Blommar den en natt, sen så dör den.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.09,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,等那么久，你怎么熬得住？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.09,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Hur orkar du vänta så länge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:23.16,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,这事啊，急不得。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:23.16,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Det här, det får ta tid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:28.47,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,可你真等了十年吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:28.47,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Men har du verkligen väntat i tio år?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:33.43,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,都快二十四年了。不过换过几株。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:33.43,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Tjugofyra nästan. Fast med olika plantor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.27,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你好像……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.27,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Du verkar …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.53,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,我是在想那株花。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.53,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Jag tänkte på plantan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.78,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,等了一辈子，然后……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.78,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Den väntar hela livet, och sen …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.04,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,……就死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.04,SV,harald,0,0,18,,… dör.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:45.57,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,真他妈让人难过。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:45.57,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Fan vad sorgligt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:46.61,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,我倒不觉得。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:46.61,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Tycker inte jag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:56.57,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:56.57,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ja!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:01.73,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:01.73,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ja!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.36,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.36,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ja!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.00,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,好，好，好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.00,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Ja, ja, ja!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:10.22,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:10.22,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.85,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,好！好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.85,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ja, ja!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.08,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,哎呀，不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.08,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Jävlar, nej!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:15.60,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,开啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:15.60,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Öppna!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.11,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.11,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:32.45,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:32.45,SV,mette,0,0,18,,God morgon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.32,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,梅尔塔，早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.32,SV,mette,0,0,18,,God morgon, Märta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.19,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.19,SV,mette,0,0,18,,God morgon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:43.71,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:43.71,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Hej.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:45.52,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:45.52,SV,mette,0,0,18,,God morgon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.28,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,来，咱们坐起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.28,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ska vi ta och sitta upp?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:50.63,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,来，慢慢来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:50.63,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Så ska vi se.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.61,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,我刚才梦到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.61,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Jag drömde om dig innan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:01:59.93,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:01:59.93,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Gjorde du det?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.25,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,那我该害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.25,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ska jag känna mig rädd, eller?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.38,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.38,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Vad är det?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.13,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,你笑什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.13,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Vad flinar du åt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.71,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.71,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Titta.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:17.37,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,我才不看。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:17.37,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Jag ska inte läsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:26.65,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,咱们洗个澡吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:26.65,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ska vi duscha?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:28.23,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:28.23,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Nej!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:30.34,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,又来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:30.34,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Inte igen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:12.47,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,我看你儿子真是个混蛋，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:12.47,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Jag tycker att din son är en stor idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.78,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,都不来这儿看看你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.78,SV,mette,0,0,18,,som inte kommer hit och hälsar på.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:18.51,ZH,mette,0,0,84,,不过你要是愿意，我能让他来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:18.51,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Men om du vill, så kan jag\Nse till att han kommer hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.10,ZH,father,0,0,55,,他不会来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.10,SV,father,0,0,18,,Han kommer inte hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.38,ZH,father,0,0,84,,等我死了，他就躲不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.38,SV,father,0,0,18,,Men när jag är död,\Ndå kan han inte komma undan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.59,ZH,father,0,0,55,,到那时他没得选。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.59,SV,father,0,0,18,,Då har han inget val.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.67,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,你去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.67,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Vart ska du?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.08,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,哪儿也不去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.08,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ingenstans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:43.14,ZH,mette,0,0,84,,你就整晚盯着一株花看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:43.14,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Håller du på och stirrar\Npå en planta hela natten?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.26,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你从来不睡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.26,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Sover du aldrig?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:45.74,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,睡得不多。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:45.74,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Nej, inte mycket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.34,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,根本没睡嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.34,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Nej, inte alls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.44,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你这人有点怪，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.44,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Du är lite knäpp, eller hur?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.69,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你跟爸妈走散了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:03.69,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Du tappade väl bort dina föräldrar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.69,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,我没爸妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.69,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Det var inga föräldrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:06.85,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,哦，我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:06.85,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Nej, jag visste inte det.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:09.10,ZH,mette,0,0,84,,那是谁在林子里找到你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:09.10,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Så vem var det som\Nhittade dig i skogen då?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.81,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,我扎到刺了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:10.81,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Jag fick en sticka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.74,ZH,harald,0,0,55,,这下有一点儿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.74,SV,harald,0,0,18,,Nu har vi fått lite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.73,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,反正这样也挺好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.73,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Det går väl bra, i alla fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:00.92,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,就刚才那件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:00.92,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Förra talet nu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.10,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,我不知道你在搞什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.10,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Jag vet inte vad du sysslar med.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:40.66,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,你可真是个坏姑娘。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:40.66,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Du är en dålig flicka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.25,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,你不嫌丢人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:44.25,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Du borde skämmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:50.15,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,可是……我想留下她呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:50.15,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Men … jag vill behålla henne!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.69,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,我想让它震得再强点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.69,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Jag vill att den ska vibrera lite mer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.62,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,这都没什么感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.62,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Det känns inte så mycket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:07.68,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,就靠电池嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:07.68,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Det är bara batterier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.92,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,屋里有股臭味。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.92,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Det stinker någonting här inne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:14.04,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,埃尔茜，不是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:14.04,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Det är inte du, Elsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:19.08,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,这东西在床上好用。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:19.08,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,De ska vara bra i sängen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:21.20,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,本来就是干这个的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:21.20,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Det är det man behöver dem till.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:28.18,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,什么东西这么难闻？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:28.18,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Vad är det som stinker?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.05,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,不过是份礼物。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.05,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Det är bara en present.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.29,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,啊，该死。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.29,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Åh, för helvete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.46,ZH,elsie,0,0,55,,可以把它放到他枕头底下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.46,SV,elsie,0,0,18,,Nu kan vi lägga den under hans kudde.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:35.24,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,最近忙什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:35.24,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Mycket på gång?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.82,ZH,friend,0,0,55,,遇上什么好事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.82,SV,friend,0,0,18,,Hänt nåt roligt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.71,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你知道哈尔德吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.71,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Du vet han Harald.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.91,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,我在墓地迷路了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.91,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Jag gick vilse på kyrkogården, förstås.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:50.31,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,你也留意到哈尔德了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:50.31,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Du märkte väl det på Harald, eller?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.39,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,不过……先别管他了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.39,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Men … skit i honom nu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:27.96,ZH,,0,0,55,,{\an7\pos(50,406)\fs27}嗅球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:27.96,SV,,0,0,18,,{\an7\pos(50,440)\fs22}Bulbus olfactorius
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.43,ZH,observer,0,0,55,,再过两个月，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.43,SV,observer,0,0,18,,Om två månader
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:39.07,ZH,observer,0,0,84,,它会长得跟右脑半球一样大。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:39.07,SV,observer,0,0,18,,kommer den att bli lika\Nstor som högra hjärnhalvan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:41.61,ZH,observer,0,0,55,,它是在夜里生长的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:41.61,SV,observer,0,0,18,,Det är på nätterna den växer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.22,ZH,observer,0,0,55,,我现在又弄明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.22,SV,observer,0,0,18,,Och nu har jag fattat det igen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:28.72,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,一位七十多岁的年轻男士，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:28.72,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Ung man på sjuttio plus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:32.65,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,想找一位同龄的年轻女士。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:32.65,SV,mette,0,0,18,,söker ung kvinna i samma ålder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.53,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,一起散散步，聊聊天。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.53,SV,mette,0,0,18,,För promenader och samtal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.35,0:11:38.18,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,听起来也没那么吓人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.35,0:11:38.18,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Det låter väl inte så farligt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.72,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,我不爱说话。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:41.72,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Jag tycker inte om att prata.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:44.04,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,写信也不合适。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:44.04,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Vi passar inte att skriva.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.98,ZH,marta,0,0,55,,我想睡觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.98,SV,marta,0,0,18,,Jag vill sova.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:49.58,ZH,mette,0,0,55,,对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:49.58,SV,mette,0,0,18,,Förlåt.
